          <_key>h40</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>Installation, adjustment and maintenance</text>
        </children>
        <style>h2</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
        <_key>p4</_key>
        <_type>block</_type>
        <children>
          <_key>p40</_key>
          <_type>span</_type>
          <text>Connection: 1″ male threads at both ends; confirm BSP/NPT for the supplied version. Before installation, confirm flow direction, operating pressure and thread standard. Fit the valve in an accessible valve box and flush the pipework before commissioning. During service, inspect the diaphragm, pilot filter, solenoid and seals. For flows below 0.68 m³/h or drip irrigation, the manufacturer recommends a 200-mesh (75 μm) upstream filter.</text>
        </children>
        <style>normal</style>
      </formattedDescription>
      <formattedDescription>
